## RelationType: 特化

来源 IRI：`https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/specializes`。来源定义：relation between two classifiers such that everything classified by the former is also classified by the latter。此 BKN 投影使用 `specializes_target_id` 保存目标实体 ID。

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| classifier | classifier | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| specializes_target_id | entity_id |
